sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Form / Meta / Zalo
  participant I as BOS L2 Receiver
  participant DB as Scoped inbox and outbox
  participant C as CRM presales writer
  participant G as L5 and L6
  participant O as Owner
  P->>I: authenticated event / account binding
  I->>DB: atomic insert unique event key + canonical hash
  DB-->>I: durable receipt
  I-->>P: protocol ACK after commit
  DB->>C: idempotent projection with scoped customer lookup
  C->>DB: Need + assignment + outbox
  DB->>O: internal assignment notification
  O->>C: authenticated ACK with expected revision
  C->>DB: accepted evidence
  alt overdue without ACK
    DB->>G: propose reassign
    G->>G: PHAP LE LY TINH + C2 policy
    G->>O: delivered notice and veto window
    G->>DB: serialize veto / dispatch / latest ACK
    G->>C: command only if authorized
  end
  C->>DB: committed receipt and reconciliation
